Control the camera from afar
- Show a thumbs up in front of the camera to take photos and start recording videos
- Show an open palm in front of the camera to stop recording videos
- Configure a timer for activating the shutter with a hand gesture

Keep your footage organized
- Set an album to automatically store photos & videos into when capturing content
- All albums created in the Camra app are stored in a nested Camra album to avoid clutter

Remember the important moments
- Flag photos & videos in albums to mark important clips
- Generate highlight reel edits of flagged clips by clicking the magic button in an album

Style the experience
- The app theme will match your device system theme
